Subject: [PATCH] feat(demo): add Schools demo spec + fix(schools): wire
 Command Center nav to Strategist/Executive Portal

- schools-command.html had zero outbound nav links to its own
  schools-strategist.html / schools-executive-portal.html, even though
  both of those pages already fully cross-link back to Command and to
  each other. Added real #tsm-chain-strat / #tsm-chain-exec links to
  the TSM cross-links bar, matching the strategist/exec-portal chain
  IDs used elsewhere in the codebase.
- Added demo/schools-demo.json + tests/e2e/demo/schools-demo.spec.js,
  source-verified against real ids/onclick handlers/functions:
  AI tab -> prompt library -> RUN AI ANALYSIS -> relay -> Strategist
  (auto-render #wrap/.kpi-row/.ai-box) -> Executive Portal.
  Not yet live-Playwright-verified (sandbox hits the same
  chrome-headless-shell 403 as Codespace).
